    "_X5_note": "Type methods complete what type definitions start. A type without its structural methods is like a name without a face — defined but not fully present. These methods give types their complete identity.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Ecclesiastes 3:11 — He hath made every thing beautiful in his time."
